{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CreateNewBusiness\">Create New Business</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account And Business Businesses Count Create Custom Customer Customers On Rate Settings Supplier Suppliers To ToDate\">Manager allows you to create and manage multiple businesses within a single installation. Each business maintains its own separate accounting records, customers, suppliers, and settings.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">Getting Started</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Businesses Code Create To ToDate\">To create a new business, first navigate to the <code>Businesses</code> tab.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 pb-6\"><div class=\"overflow-visible bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-neutral-100 shadow shadow-neutral-400\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center mx-8 p-6 text-neutral-500 whitespace-nowrap bg-neutral-200 shadow-inner shadow-neutral-400\"><i class=\"text-base fas fa-building\"></i><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Businesses\">Businesses</span></span></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add AddBusiness And Business Code Create CreateNewBusiness From FromDate On Select To ToDate\">Click the <code>Add Business</code> button and select <code>Create New Business</code> from the dropdown menu.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 text-sm\"><details open><summary class=\"border font-bold rounded-md py-3 px-4 bg-[#428bca] border-[#357ebd] text-white [box-shadow:_inset_0px_1px_0px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AddBusiness\">Add Business</span></summary><div class=\"mt-2 py-2 rounded-md shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"px-8 py-2 text-white bg-[#428BCA] whitespace-nowrap\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CreateNewBusiness\">Create New Business</span></div><hr class=\"my-2\" /><div class=\"px-8 py-2 text-gray-700 whitespace-nowrap\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ImportBusiness\">Import Business</span></div></div></details></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Businesses BusinessName Code Is Name\">Enter a meaningful name in the <code>Business Name</code> field. This name will help you identify this business when you have multiple businesses in Manager.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Automatic ChartOfAccounts Code Count Country From FromDate Is Location On Other Select Settings Tax TaxCode TaxCodes To ToDate\">If available, select your country from the <code>Country</code> dropdown. This will automatically configure tax codes, chart of accounts, and other settings appropriate for your location.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Code Create CreateNewBusiness On To ToDate\">Click the <code>Create New Business</code> button to complete the setup.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 text-sm\"><span class=\"border font-semibold rounded-md py-3 px-4 bg-[#428bca] border-[#357ebd] text-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CreateNewBusiness\">Create New Business</span></span></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Tabs\">Default Tabs</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Code Summary To ToDate\">After creating your business, you'll be taken to the <code>Summary</code> tab.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-presentation text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Summary\">Summary</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Is Tabs\">Four tabs are displayed by default:</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Code On Position Summary View\">• <code>Summary</code> — Overview of your business's financial position</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"LearnMore\">Learn more:</span> <a href=\"/guides/summary-view\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Summary\">Summary</span></a></p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Action Code Count Journal JournalEntries On Transaction Transactions\">• <code>Journal Entries</code> — Record accounting transactions</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"LearnMore\">Learn more:</span> <a href=\"/guides/journal-entries\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"JournalEntries\">Journal Entries</span></a></p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Code FinancialStatements Other Port Rate Reports Statement\">• <code>Reports</code> — Generate financial statements and other reports</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"LearnMore\">Learn more:</span> <a href=\"/guides/reports\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reports\">Reports</span></a></p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Business BusinessDetails Code Count On Reference Settings\">• <code>Settings</code> — Configure accounts, preferences, and business details</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"LearnMore\">Learn more:</span> <a href=\"/guides/settings\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></a></p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">Basic vs Full Features</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action And ChartOfAccounts Code Count FinancialStatements Journal JournalEntries On Rate Statement Tabs Transaction Transactions\">These default tabs provide a minimal double-entry accounting system. You can set up your <code>Chart of Accounts</code>, enter transactions through <code>Journal Entries</code>, and generate financial statements.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accountants Count FinancialStatements From FromDate Is On Statement To ToDate\">This basic configuration is ideal for accountants who need to quickly prepare financial statements from existing data.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add And Business Businesses Custom Customer From FromDate On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders Sales To ToDate\">Most businesses will benefit from enabling additional features such as sales invoicing, inventory tracking, purchase orders, and customer management.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Custom To ToDate\">Customizing Your Business</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add Code Custom Customize On To ToDate\">To enable additional features, click the <code>Customize</code> button located in the navigation area.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-3 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-presentation text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Summary\">Summary</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-b border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-50 p-3 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"JournalEntries\">Journal Entries</span></span><span class=\"whitespace-nowrap border font-normal tabular-nums py-0.5 px-2 bg-white rounded-lg text-neutral-300 border-neutral-200 text-xs\">0</span></div><div class=\"border-x border-b border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-50 p-3 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-print text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reports\">Reports</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-b border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-50 p-3 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-e border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-200 text-center pb-4\"><div class=\"py-4 font-semibold text-[#428bca] text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customize\">Customize</span></div><i class=\"fas fa-hand-pointer text-neutral-400 text-xl\"></i></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Is On\">This opens a comprehensive list of available modules and features. You can enable only the features your business needs, keeping the interface clean and focused.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Enabled Is To ToDate\">Features can be enabled or disabled at any time without losing data. This allows your system to grow with your business needs.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom On Tabs To ToDate\">For detailed information about customizing tabs, see:</span> <a href=\"/guides/tabs-form\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Tabs\">Tabs</span></a></p>",
  "key": "create-new-business"
}
